src/azmod/icons/ and the icon bitmaps in src/azmod/menu_icons.h
  Sources and SHA-256 of every file are in src/azmod/icons/SOURCES.txt.
  - cil-*.svg: CoreUI Icons Free 3.0.1 by creativeLabs Lukasz Holeczek, CC BY 4.0
    (src/azmod/icons/LICENSE-COREUI-ICONS), https://github.com/coreui/coreui-icons
