    MIT (src/azmod/icons/LICENSE-FRAMEWORK7-ICONS),
    https://github.com/framework7io/framework7-icons
  - info-circle-svgrepo.svg: "info circle" (outline) from the Solar icon set by
    480 Design, CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/),
